## SQ-NS-01 | nightstand storage (first half; restart half in p1b)
@group A
@commands `/setblock` an oak and an Every Compat nightstand; a hopper above each holding one sugar feeds it (item handler; `/item replace block` refuses it); restart; `/data get block`; break it with a bot
@pass `CENightstandItems` holds the sugar after the restart; the sugar drops on break; a hopper below pulls it
@fails `HandcraftedItemHoldingSaveMixin` (save/load names), `NightstandStorage` item handler
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
> setblock 40 -60 10 handcrafted:oak_nightstand
> setblock 42 -60 10 everycomp:hc/architects_palette/twisted_nightstand
# judge-13, 2026-11-18: the storage is an item handler capability, not a vanilla Container, so `item replace block`
# answers "is not a container" (r1118); a hopper above feeds it through the capability instead
> setblock 40 -59 10 minecraft:hopper[facing=down]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:sugar",Count:1b}]}
> setblock 42 -59 10 minecraft:hopper[facing=down]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:sugar",Count:1b}]}
sleep 3
> data get block 40 -60 10
> data get block 42 -60 10
count CENightstandItems: \[\{.*minecraft:sugar >= 2
> setblock 44 -60 10 handcrafted:oak_nightstand
> setblock 44 -61 10 minecraft:hopper
> setblock 44 -59 10 minecraft:hopper[facing=down]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:sugar",Count:1b}]}
sleep 4
# r1123cx (2026-11-23): read the nightstand too, so an empty hopper below tells "never entered" from "not pulled"
> data get block 44 -61 10 Items
expect minecraft:sugar
> data get block 44 -60 10
> data get block 44 -59 10 Items
look the hopper below pulled the sugar; restart and break halves in p1b

## SQ-SVA-05 | brewery sky houses carry hanging herbs
@phase worldgen
@group A
@commands `/place template skyvillages:letsdo_brewery/sky_village_letsdo_brewery_0` and `_1`
@pass `fantasyfurniture:decorations/hanging_herbs` at 4 and 2 spots (SVA-08)
@fails `brewery:dried_*` rows in `tools/skyvillage_addon_remap.json`, rerun the tool
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
> forceload add 96 96 160 160
> place template skyvillages:letsdo_brewery/sky_village_letsdo_brewery_0 100 -40 100
> place template skyvillages:letsdo_brewery/sky_village_letsdo_brewery_1 130 -40 100
sleep 3
> cdevtest count 95 -45 95 127 0 128 fantasyfurniture:decorations/hanging_herbs
> cdevtest count 128 -45 95 160 0 128 fantasyfurniture:decorations/hanging_herbs
> cdevtest count 95 -45 95 160 0 128 brewery:dried_wheat
expect verb=count block=fantasyfurniture:decorations/hanging_herbs n=4\b
expect verb=count block=fantasyfurniture:decorations/hanging_herbs n=2\b
expect verb=count block=brewery:dried_wheat n=0\b
reject verb=count .*skipped_columns=[1-9]
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look the first count is template 0 (4), the second template 1 (2)

## SQ-TSK-02 | tomato vines climb treated sticks
@group A
@commands FD tomato vine on farmland with `creativedelight:treated_stick` two above, `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 300`; repeat with `supplementaries:stick_tomatoes` under a treated stick
@pass the vine climbs into `creativedelight:treated_stick_tomatoes`, stops at three high
@fails `TomatoClimbTreatedStickMixin` / `SuppTomatoClimbTreatedStickMixin`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1101/p1_server.qb
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> setblock -10 -61 30 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
# age 1 (judge-13, 2026-11-18): a max-age (3) FD vine is not randomly ticking (CropBlock), so it never reached attemptRopeClimb in r1118
> setblock -10 -60 30 farmersdelight:tomatoes[age=1]
> setblock -10 -59 30 creativedelight:treated_stick
> setblock -10 -58 30 creativedelight:treated_stick
> setblock -8 -61 30 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock -8 -60 30 supplementaries:stick_tomatoes
> setblock -8 -59 30 creativedelight:treated_stick
# 300 rounds (judge-13, 2026-11-18): 100 left the FD vine unclimbed in r1118, rules out chance
> cdevtest randomtick -10 -60 30 -8 -57 30 300
expect verb=randomtick .*changed=[1-9]
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> execute if block -10 -59 30 creativedelight:treated_stick_tomatoes
> execute if block -10 -57 30 minecraft:air
> execute if block -8 -59 30 creativedelight:treated_stick_tomatoes
count Test passed >= 2
look FD vine climbed into treated_stick_tomatoes, at most three high; Supplementaries stick tomatoes likewise (third Test passed)

